DevOps Backups — Privacy Policy

This application is used solely by Gil Hauer for personal backups. It uses Google Drive authorization to create, read, and delete its backup files, including deletion according to the configured retention policy.

Backup contents are encrypted locally before upload to Google Drive. OAuth credentials are stored on the personal backup machine and are not published or shared. The application does not sell data, use it for advertising, or share it with third parties other than Google Drive for storage.

Access can be revoked through Google Account settings. Revoking access does not delete existing backups; these can be deleted separately from Google Drive.

